<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-518] TTL is not updated for reader when entry is accessed on backup</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-518</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When ttl is updated, readers are recorded locally and update is then sent based on collected data. When get is performed on backup, readers are empty, so near readers are not updated.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteCacheAtomicExpiryPolicyTest.testNearAccess&lt;/tt&gt; fails.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12783473">IGNITE-518</key>
            <summary>TTL is not updated for reader when entry is accessed on backup</summary>
