                            <comment id="15771011" author="alpert" created="Thu, 22 Dec 2016 20:25:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi. I want to work on that bug. Can you briefly explain what is the expected logic?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15821518" author="amashenkov" created="Fri, 13 Jan 2017 09:49:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We must bother that NearCache expires on client nodes as well and add tests for it.&lt;br/&gt;
One of such test - IgniteCacheAtomicExpiryPolicyTest.testNearExpiresOnClient can be merged to IgniteCacheAtomicExpiryPolicyTest.testNearAccess when exripation issue will be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15871531" author="amashenkov" created="Fri, 17 Feb 2017 09:37:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It looks like issue was resolved within &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4036&quot; title=&quot;Near cache is not expired together with corresponding server cache&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-4036&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-4036&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, so tests should be unmuted.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15930124" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 17 Mar 2017 15:22:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user AMashenkov opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1636&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1636&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-518&quot; title=&quot;TTL is not updated for reader when entry is accessed on backup&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-518&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-518&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: unmute fixed tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Unmute tests that was fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4036&quot; title=&quot;Near cache is not expired together with corresponding server cache&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-4036&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-4036&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

